{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120111","id":3831871003,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7kZbYb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120111","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120111.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120111.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120111","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120111/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120111/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120111/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7ab83282045b5031f07a6709d5f90af023ae8090","number":120111,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't flush the message queue before a MainLoop is iterating (Reverted)","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Allowing this breaks several assumptions in the engine, normally this doesn't occur but when using the WTP it can occur. For instance during resource loading the message queue is serviced during tear down.\r\n\r\nThis means this situation can be created from user code if they do async resource loading in the `_load` of a resource in the main scene.\r\n\r\nThis also makes the MainLoop report that it IS iterating during tests as the tests expect the message queue to be serviced even though no main loop is running.\r\n\r\nThis is a prerequisite for #120072 ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","eve